{"id": "1823797", "name": "מציאת ערך ט\"ל על וקטור נוסף ממטריצות 2X2 לפולינומים", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "random_invertible_matrix", "params": ["n"], "body": "genmatrix (LowerWithDiag, n, n).transpose(genmatrix (LowerWithDiag, n, n))"}, {"name": "colToPoly", "params": ["cl"], "body": "sum(cl[i][1]*x^(i-1),i,1,length(cl))"}, {"name": "colToMatrix", "params": ["cl", "m", "n"], "body": "apply(matrix, makelist(makelist(cl[i+n*(j-1),1],i,1,n),j,1,m ))"}, {"name": "matToCol", "params": ["mat"], "body": "transpose(flatten(args(mat)))"}, {"name": "polyToCol", "params": ["p", "n"], "body": "transpose(makelist(coeff(p, x, i-1),i,n))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>תהא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(T:M_2(\\mathbb{R}) \\to \\mathbb{R}_2[x]\\)</span> העתקה לינארית שמקיימת</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ T {{CT:0}} = {{CT:1}},\\quad T {{CT:2}} = {{CT:3}},\\quad T {{CT:4}} = {{CT:5}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>האם מנתונים אלה ניתן לדעת מי הוא הפולינום <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:6}}\\)</span> המקיים</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ T {{CT:7}} ={{CT:6}} \\]</p><p>אם כן, מצאו אותו.</p><p>האם אפשר למצוא את הפולינום?</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p>אם כן, מי הוא? (אם לא ניתן למצוא, אין צורך למלא שום דבר).</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(T {{CT:7}}={{CT:6}} = \\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]<br><br>", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "boolean", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "a+b*x+c*x^2", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "ta2: is(ans1=true) and is(equal(polyToCol(ans2,m),rand_mat . lin_comb));\n", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "can_be_found[idx]", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "ta2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובה נכונה, זה אכן הוקטור המבוקש.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">קיים וקטור שלא מצאת אותו.</div>"}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "false", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובה נכונה, לא קיים וקטור כזה.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובה שגויה. לא קיים וקטור כזה.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["LowerWithDiag", "ans_output_of_trans", "ans_vec", "base_mat", "can_be_found", "idx", "lin_comb", "lin_comb_0", "m", "n", "rand_mat", "v1", "v2", "v3", "v4", "w1", "w2", "w3"], "nvariants": 50}